<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI 策略平台</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        section {
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #333;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>AI 加密货币策略平台</h1>
    </header>
    <section>
        <div class="card">
            <h2>欢迎来到 AI 策略平台</h2>
            <p>在这里，你可以获取最新的市场策略、趋势分析和投资建议。</p>
            <a href="https://www.binance.com" class="button" target="_blank">查看实时市场数据</a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <h2>如何使用</h2>
            <p>请输入你感兴趣的加密货币，AI 会为你提供建议。</p>
            <input type="text" placeholder="请输入币种" id="coin-input" />
            <button class="button" id="get-strategy">获取策略</button>
            <p id="strategy-result"></p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <script>
        document.getElementById("get-strategy").addEventListener("click", function() {
            var coin = document.getElementById("coin-input").value;
            if (coin) {
                document.getElementById("strategy-result").innerText = "AI 策略建议：购买 " + coin + "，市场看涨。";
            } else {
                document.getElementById("strategy-result").innerText = "请输入有效的币种名称！";
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
